      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    purchase_price = 50.00\n    shares = 100\n    commission_per_share = 0.05\n    leverage_ratio = 2.0\n    call_money_rate = 0.06\n    ending_price = 70.00\n    dividend_per_share = 0.50\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    stock_cost = purchase_price * shares\n    commission = commission_per_share * shares\n    initial_equity = stock_cost / leverage_ratio + commission\n    borrowed_amount = stock_cost - stock_cost / leverage_ratio\n    interest = borrowed_amount * call_money_rate\n    ending_value = ending_price * shares\n    dividends = dividend_per_share * shares\n    net_profit = ending_value + dividends - stock_cost - commission - interest\n    total_return = net_profit / initial_equity * 100\n\n    # return answer\n    return round(total_return, 2)\n```",
